1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The female connector has bayonet slots on the inside.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Connect a hose of fitting size with a worm drive clamp (not shown).

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Insert the male connector lugs into the slots of the female one.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Twist to close as indicated on the outside of the connector.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Twist in reverse to unlock the connection.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Remove the hose from the female connector by pulling,
possibly applying tension in the open direction.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
You can specify any hose diameter that fits onto your build plate.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
The same goes for the hose fitting length, limited by the build volume you have.

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
The 3MF you download from customization has a plate for each part.

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Good luck with printing your parts!
